-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §19 הערכת מורים: under the reform the
-- school's management evaluates all its teachers, by the Ministry's
-- professional guidelines — set in advance coordination with the
-- organisation, with ראמ"ה or another body the Ministry chooses, for three
-- years at least ("the evaluation model"); a dispute over the model is the
-- Ministry's director-general's to decide, save that on the first model,
-- built in תשע"ב, a committee of three decides by a majority, by 31.5.2012.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `19 הערכת מורים`

DECLARE `Oz section 19 action` IS ONE OF
    `evaluate all the school's teachers by the evaluation model`
    `decide a dispute over the evaluation model`
    `decide every dispute over the first evaluation model`

-- The school's management evaluates all the teachers in the school, by the
-- Ministry's professional guidelines (no deadline: convention
-- dates.no-deadline). The guidelines are set elsewhere: in advance
-- coordination with the organisation, with the help of ראמ"ה or another
-- body the Ministry chooses, for a period of three years at least ("לפחות":
-- 3 is in).
@ref akn:art_19/p1
`evaluating the school's teachers` MEANS
    PARTY `the school management`
    MUST  `evaluate all the school's teachers by the evaluation model`

`why the evaluation model is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "ההנחיות המקצועיות של משרד החינוך להערכת מורים (\"מודל ההערכה\"), שייקבעו בתיאום מוקדם עם ארגון המורים"

GIVEN `the years the model is set for` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the evaluation model is set for long enough` `the years the model is set for` IF
    `the years the model is set for` AT LEAST 3

-- A dispute between the Ministry and the organisation over the model or
-- the process is decided by the Ministry's director-general; but on the
-- first model, built in תשע"ב, by a committee of the director-general, the
-- organisation's chairman and Prof. Yitzhak Friedman, by a majority, which
-- decides every dispute by 31.5.2012 (the day included: convention
-- dates.end), counted from the signing.
@ref akn:art_19/p1
GIVEN `a dispute over the first model, built in 5772` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides a dispute over the evaluation model` `a dispute over the first model, built in 5772` IS
    IF `a dispute over the first model, built in 5772`
    THEN `the Oz evaluation-model committee`
    ELSE `the director-general`

`the members of the Oz evaluation-model committee` MEANS 3

GIVEN `members for the decision` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee decides by a majority with` `members for the decision` IF
    `members for the decision` TIMES 2 GREATER THAN `the members of the Oz evaluation-model committee`

`days from the Oz signing to 31.5.2012` MEANS
    DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 2012) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 14 8 2011)

`deciding the disputes over the first model` MEANS
    PARTY `the Oz evaluation-model committee`
    MUST  `decide every dispute over the first evaluation model`
    WITHIN `days from the Oz signing to 31.5.2012`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Oz evaluation-model committee` BECAUSE "§19: the committee decides every dispute over the first model by 31.5.2012"

`deciding a dispute over the model` MEANS
    PARTY `the director-general`
    MUST  `decide a dispute over the evaluation model`

§§ `19 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `who decides a dispute over the evaluation model` TRUE EQUALS `the Oz evaluation-model committee`
#ASSERT `who decides a dispute over the evaluation model` FALSE EQUALS `the director-general`
#ASSERT `the committee decides by a majority with` 2 AND NOT `the committee decides by a majority with` 1
#ASSERT `the evaluation model is set for long enough` 3
#ASSERT `days from the Oz signing to 31.5.2012` EQUALS 291
